  "runtimeSupport": {
    "board": "lilygo-t-hmi",
    "status": "diagnostic",
    "scope": "接入 T-HMI 的 ST7789 240×320 原生屏、GPIO 位操作和 LCD_CAM i80 传输、GPIO10 外设电源门控、BOOT／用户键，以及真实 SDMMC 单线 TF 卡。T-HMI 的数据线顺序单独验证，不套用 T-Display S3。物理 XPT2046 电阻触摸、电池自锁和亮度调节尚未模拟。",
    "unsupported": [
      "Official factory binary boot and physical hardware validation are unverified. Native authored Xtensa SRAM fixtures execute the documented peripheral MMIO.",
      "Native portrait framebuffer; factory uses swapXY/mirror through real DCS commands. Screen appears only after display initialization, peripheral enable10 and backlight38.",
      "USB-present digital subset: battery self-hold GPIO14 and analog battery/charger states are not a system power simulator.",
      "XPT2046 SPI touch controller is physically present but unimplemented; no fabricated calibration values or touch button are exposed.",
      "SDMMC accepts exact clock12/command11/data0=13 with one-bit width, guest DMA SRAM bounds and real host/card commands; no invented SPI CS. SDMMC wire timing and card analog supply are absent."
    ],
    "firmwareCompatibility": "No factory image is claimed working by a board protocol test."
  },
